  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact of the project:
Improved productive contribution of youth as accountable political leaders at national, provincial &amp; local (Pradeshiya Saba) level on democracy and good governance.

Target Group: Youth population in Sri Lanka</narrative>
